---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — LicensingMadeSimple" description="We make business licensing simple. Powered by Cornerstone Licensing.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About LicensingMadeSimple</h1>
      <p>We built this because licensing shouldn't require a law degree.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h2>The Problem We're Solving</h2>
      <p>Business licensing is confusing by default. Every state has different rules. The forms are dense. The jargon is impenetrable. And small mistakes cause weeks of delays. We built LicensingMadeSimple to be the opposite: clear information, plain language, and a fast path from "I need a license" to "I have one."</p>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>Answer 3 questions in our roadmap wizard. See your license type, timeline, and estimated cost. If you want help with the filing, a dedicated specialist handles everything from application to approval.</p>

      <h2>Who Handles the Work</h2>
      <p>All licensing work is performed by <a href="https://cornerstonelicensing.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cornerstone Licensing</a>, one of the most experienced licensing firms in the country. 28 years in business. 525,000+ filings. 50 states. 99.995% on-time submission rate. 97% first-submission approval rate.</p>
      <p>That experience is what makes the "simple" part possible. When your specialist has filed thousands of the same license type, they know exactly what every state needs. No guesswork, no trial and error.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .article h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .article h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .article p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
</style>
